// The smallest grammar there is — one literal, one publication, no captures, no
// alternatives, nothing to backtrack into. The baseline for the ongoing work on what a
// capture costs (benchmarks/README.md, "What captures cost"): every step from here adds
// exactly one thing, and Minimal.gram.g.cs is where the diff shows what that one thing
// cost in generated code.

A = "a"

parse A
